WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:24.330
Earth was suddenly attacked by a space fleet of unknown origin.The space fleet's attack effectively destroyed the Earth.

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:29.920
Macross, carrying more than 50k refugees, used an emergency Fold  to  escape to the orbit of Pluto. Then several months passed…

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:55.030
Did you say that vessel does not belong to the Meltlan?

00:00:55.030 --> 00:01:00.660
In the wreckage of enemy ships that we've captured in battle up to now,

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:04.330
we have confirmed many objects of Miclone size.

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.420
I shall show you.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:15.800
Miclone size... Indeed, it seems
these do not belong to Meltlandi.

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:17.260
Furthermore,

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:22.850
a number of our soldiers received strange sound signals near the enemy vessel

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.060
and became unable to fight.

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:29.190
Unable to fight?!

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:33.940
What could they have aboard that ship?

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:23.240
All right, it's looking better now.

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:29.920
That's a roger, Soarer.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.340
This is Leopard 3141.

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:32.790
Aye, aye, sir.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:35.630
Leopard is in 3521 to Soarer 6200.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:37.260
Don't send radar signals on our tail.

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:38.720
ASK communication line established.

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:39.630
Okay, 200, keep it right there.

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:41.680
Delta One to ARMD-01, as well as

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:41.760
Charlie! Charlie!

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:44.180
Squadrons Skull, Angel, and Apollo:

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:45.720
Stand by to launch.

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:51.100
All systems green. Good luck to you.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:52.770
Thank you!

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:04.720
ookina HEART ga kasanete futatsu
Two hearts come together

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:11.890
aoi aozora LOVE SIGN
It's a love sign in the big blue sky

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:15.440
I LOVE YOU, YOU LOVE ME?
"I love you, you love me?"

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:20.070
dakedo karettara watashi yori
But he's head over heels

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:26.160
jibun no hikouki ni onetsu nano
For his plane, instead of me

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:29.700
kyuun kyuun kyuun kyuun
Whoosh, whoosh! Whoosh, whoosh!

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:36.460
watashi no kare wa PILOT
My boyfriend is a pilot

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:47.140
Minmay, Minmay, Minmay...!

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:54.640
Good evening, everyone! I'm Lynn Minmay!

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:06.700
Tonight is my first concert, and so many of you came! Thank you very much!

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.700
Minmay!

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:09.700
Thank you!

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:15.790
It's already been five months since our Macross left Earth.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:23.130
A lot has happened since then, and we have all suffered a lot of hardship.

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:31.100
But tonight, let's forget those sad times and really enjoy ourselves!

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:41.070
And now, I will perform a song from my soon-to-be-released first album.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:45.530
REMEMBER
Remember

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:49.910
oozora mau shirogane no tsubasa
The silver wings that danced in the lofty sky

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:56.330
Shao Pai Lon Shao Pai Lon
Shao Pai Lon! Shao Pai Lon!

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.040
REMEMBER
Remember

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:03.300
moeru hitomi yami o saku
The burning eyes that tear apart the darkness

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:09.390
Shao Pai Lon Shao Pai Lon
Shao Pai Lon! Shao Pai Lon!

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:17.140
yameru miyako motomete kita otoko
The man who came to save the ailing capital

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:24.860
EVIL SLAYER SLAYER SLAYER
Evil's slayer! Slayer! Slayer!

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:26.900
Shao Pai Lon...
Shao Pai Lon...

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:34.870
Attention! Attention!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:38.250
Our ship is to make a transformation in three minutes.

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.870
Go to the nearest shelter as soon as possible.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:44.880
Attention! Attention!

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:46.380
A transformation! It's going to transform again!

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:48.090
Our ship is to make a transformation in three minutes.

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:49.380
Go to the nearest shelter—

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:56.140
Delta One to all units in Squadrons Skull, Angel, and Apollo:

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:59.890
Correct course to 308 plus A15.

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:02.230
Enemy estimated to be within firing range in thirty seconds.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:03.860
Prepare to intercept the enemy.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:09.030
Skull Leader to all units: You heard the lady.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:11.610
Assume intercept formation 17.

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:12.530
Got it?

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:13.160
Roger!

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:49.280
Got them!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.110
It's too soon to celebrate!

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:53.360
Match up one-on-one and move to intercept.

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:55.320
Now, reverse thrust and break formation!

00:07:58.120 --> 00:07:59.080
Roger!

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.040
Three of them, huh?

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:06.840
All right.

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:14.590
They're good!

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:24.480
Take care of them, Max!

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:25.230
Roger!

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:35.450
Three of them down!

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:36.950
Wow!

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:38.950
He really is a genius!

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:40.200
I can do that too!

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:56.550
Got him!

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:05.350
This is Delta One to all units:

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:10.860
A large battle cruiser has just de-folded in area 108 and is heading directly for us!

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:12.070
Move immediately to intercept.

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:14.570
The battle pods here were decoys!

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:56.400
Delta One to Skull Eleven:

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:59.280
You're supposed to be attacking the enemy vessel!

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:00.660
Return to your assigned position immediately!

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:02.240
Are you kidding?

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:04.660
I just saved your life! Is that any way to speak to me?

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:07.080
Insubordination will land you in the brig.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:08.670
Don't disobey me, rookie!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:11.420
They're infiltrating the ship! I can't just do nothing!

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.710
Let Defense Group Two handle it!

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:14.920
That's an order!

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:19.550
Like I'm gonna take that kind of order! I'm going after the enemies that have entered the ship.

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.930
Wait a second!

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:25.470
Damn, who does he think gives the orders around here, men or women?

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:35.940
Transformation starts in one minute.

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:38.950
I wonder if we'll be okay today.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:41.450
It's more intense than usual.

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:01.640
Minmay! Run!

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:05.140
What?!

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:06.930
Zentran and Meltlan!

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:10.940
Zentran and Meltlan in same place!

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:11.560
What did you say?!

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:14.570
It's...

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:17.570
It's terrible!

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:20.610
Transformation in T-minus five seconds,

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:21.490
four,

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:22.570
three,

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:23.200
two,

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:23.950
one,

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:24.070
Minmay!

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.490
transform.

00:11:57.690 --> 00:12:00.110
Gravity system 11 is damaged.

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:01.700
The subsystem is also inoperable!

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:59.340
Enemy ship is approaching. Course 107.

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:01.710
Course confirmed. Activate targeting.

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:04.550
Energy level rising. Main gun, stand by.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:12.810
Fire!

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:07.110
No way!

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:14.240
It's really her!

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.170
You saved me?

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:27.470
Ah, yes!

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:33.430
You rescued me, didn't you?

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:40.520
I-I'm E-Ensign Ichijo Hikaru, attached to the U.N. Spacy Valkyrie Skull Squadron.

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.690
Thank you, Ensign.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.900
I-It's okay. I'm a big fan of yours.

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:48.360
I'm so happy! Do you listen to my songs?

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:51.110
Y-Yes! All the time.

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:54.280
Everyone's probably worried.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.790
So, Ensign, do you know where we ar—

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:00.870
Uh, could I please have your autograph?

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:01.670
What?

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:03.000
Oh, sure...

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:06.760
Here you go.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:07.670
Wow, thanks!

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:12.640
We fell into the engine block.

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:14.220
Is there a way out?

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:15.260
I'll go look.

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:23.360
It doesn't look like there are any.

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:24.980
Can't you break through the wall?

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:27.980
That's impossible. It's made of hyper-carbon.

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:30.070
Just a sec.

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.410
It's useless. There's too much static.

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:35.450
Can you get the plane's radio to work?

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:36.410
No...

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:38.370
It's all smashed up.

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:39.540
I see.

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:41.580
Anyone?

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:44.500
Is anyone out there?

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:51.220
Hopeless?

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:55.680
That's fine!

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.890
I've had enough of my packed schedule.

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:01.180
Huh?

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:04.310
This means I can take a little break.

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:06.440
Huh!

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:10.400
What was that, Ensign?

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:13.110
The Macross must be breaking away from Titan's orbit.

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:14.450
Really?

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:15.740
It's the truth.

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:28.090
The gravity control isn't functioning!

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:31.340
W-Wait, Minmay-san!

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:33.050
If you move around like that...

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:33.050
No!

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:37.760
It was an accident!

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:38.850
A mistake!

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:41.310
Never mind that! Do something!

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:46.270
Swing your legs forward and stop them slowly!

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:47.730
Like this?

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:53.030
Good! That's the way.

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:55.700
This is fun.

00:16:58.490 --> 00:16:59.660
Minmay-san!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:00.740
Don't go there!

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:04.710
Wait!

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:08.590
Minmay-san!

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:09.380
Ow!

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:12.260
I broke the flashlight.

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:21.060
Look! Look!

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:27.310
What do you think? These are the latest in fashion light holography!

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:38.370
There're some vegetables and a tuna floating around.

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:39.950
They must have fallen in here too.

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:44.500
Look, there's even a doll of me here too.

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:50.590
0-G LOVE 0-G LOVE
Zero-G love! Zero-G love!

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:59.220
kare to gakkou no kaerimichi
On the way home from school with my boyfriend

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:05.770
itsumo no kado no wakaremichi
We part ways at the usual corner

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:10.480
hito ga inai no misumashite
Making sure no one's around

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:17.610
yokoku mo nashi ni KISS sareta
He kissed me without warning

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:23.330
watashi ichiou okotta furi
I'm pretending to be angry for now

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:26.830
dakedo dakedo dakedo
But! But! But...!

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:30.170
atama furafura kokoro fuwafuwa
My head's dizzy and my heart's aflutter

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:32.880
0-G LOVE 0-G LOVE
Zero-G love! Zero-G love!

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:36.550
4-3-2-1 0-G LOVE
Four! Three! Two! One! Zero-G love!

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:44.970
karada ga kaze ni notte tonde yuku
Riding on the wind, my body soars

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:07.540
We've received some terrible news from the invasion unit.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:11.790
Miclones exist inside the enemy vessel, as suspected. Furthermore...

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:13.460
Wait! Increase the magnification.

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:19.170
These are... Miclones of Zentran and Meltlan!

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:25.430
It is so. There are many other confirmed scenes of Zentran and Meltlan in coexistence.

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:27.430
What are you saying?

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:30.980
I have a dreadful premonition.

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:35.610
Our ancient combat manual says,

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:40.700
"Do not attack Miclones. Those who do will perish."

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:46.200
Perish? Meaning our fleet will lose?

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:50.290
Ridiculous...

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:58.550
Is this a Miclone, of a Miclone?!

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:12.940
kyuun kyuun kyuun kyuun
Whoosh, whoosh! Whoosh, whoosh!

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:12.310
It moved! It moved!

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:14.190
Retreat!

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:17.650
watashi no kare wa PILOT
My boyfriend is a pilot

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:16.020
What, is it?!

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:17.190
It's a sound weapon!

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:18.570
What a sound!!

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:21.570
kirari hikatte kyuukouka
Shining and making a rapid descent...

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:25.240
gotto fukashite kyuujyoushou
As it makes a long jet stream trail

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:31.250
nagaku ookiku hikoukigumo de
As it makes a long tail of jet stream cloud

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:38.000
ookina HEART ga kasanete futatsu
Two hearts come together

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:53.730
Anyway...

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:56.600
there's still no proof that they're dead.

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:57.360
Yes, sir.

00:20:57.810 --> 00:21:00.900
Today we'll thoroughly search the west block.

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:02.440
All right, good idea.

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:04.990
Excuse us.

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:08.990
That kid still hasn't been found yet, huh?

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:10.700
Well, it has been three days.

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:12.580
He joined the service,

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:14.430
but maybe he got scared and deserted.

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:15.330
No way.

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:18.040
He's not cut out for the military.

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:21.090
You know, a boy will be unhappy for life if he chooses the wrong occupation.

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:25.840
I just mean that choosing another line of work would be in his best interest.

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:27.930
Critical, as always.

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:29.060
If you keep this up...

00:21:29.060 --> 00:21:31.720
"No one will ever want to marry me"?

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:34.180
That's all right.

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:38.350
I stopped thinking of myself as a girl a long time ago.

00:21:38.350 --> 00:21:39.270
Not that again.

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:40.980
Stop talking like an old maid.

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:42.110
But don't worry.

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:45.360
I can guarantee you'll...

00:22:09.510 --> 00:22:13.100
And then my mom and dad said,

00:22:13.100 --> 00:22:16.020
"Don't you know how rigid your brother is?

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:20.060
If you don't behave, I'll disown you!"

00:22:20.730 --> 00:22:25.490
So I thanked them for taking care of me and told them that

00:22:25.490 --> 00:22:29.320
I was going to work very hard and one day become a famous singer.

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:30.490
And then?

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:37.910
Then I left home and came here.

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:39.500
That's amazing.

00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:40.750
But you know...

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:44.590
I think that maybe I overdid it a little.

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:52.050
I just hope that they're all right.

00:22:52.760 --> 00:22:54.640
Aren't they on the Macross?

00:22:58.060 --> 00:22:59.350
They're on Earth.

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:02.610
Earth, huh?

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:13.450
Do you know what's happened on Earth?

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:17.910
The official announcement says heavy radio jamming is preventing us from making contact.

00:23:18.660 --> 00:23:20.370
Not that. I mean the truth.

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:24.920
They took such heavy bombardment that

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:27.010
I doubt anyone was safe.

00:23:29.050 --> 00:23:30.050
I see...

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:36.220
But don't worry. In only a month, we'll be able to go home.

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:37.640
Yeah...

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:42.770
Hey, can I ask you a question?

00:23:42.770 --> 00:23:43.690
What?

00:23:43.690 --> 00:23:45.110
About your recent TV show...

00:23:45.480 --> 00:23:46.270
Television?

00:23:46.270 --> 00:23:48.230
Yes, "For Nights When You Want to Cry."

00:23:48.230 --> 00:23:50.400
There are rumors floating around about you and that other actor.

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:52.990
You're taking them seriously too?

00:23:52.990 --> 00:23:55.620
They're only stories made up by magazines.

00:23:55.620 --> 00:23:57.950
But... how do I put it...?

00:23:57.950 --> 00:24:01.500
That love scene was so real.

00:24:04.170 --> 00:24:05.590
Oh, come on.

00:24:08.840 --> 00:24:11.590
It was just acting. Strictly business!

00:24:12.220 --> 00:24:13.340
No way!

00:24:13.840 --> 00:24:15.430
Want me to show you?

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:16.850
Show me?

00:24:25.610 --> 00:24:27.230
Oh, Hikaru...

00:24:27.230 --> 00:24:28.230
Wha—

00:24:29.820 --> 00:24:34.240
I-I've always loved you.

00:24:35.070 --> 00:24:36.820
Say that you love me.

00:24:36.820 --> 00:24:38.080
B-But...

00:24:38.080 --> 00:24:39.330
I see...

00:24:40.450 --> 00:24:42.620
You don't love me, do you?

00:24:42.620 --> 00:24:44.920
N-No. I do love you!

00:24:46.080 --> 00:24:47.750
Really?

00:24:47.750 --> 00:24:49.550
Y-Yes, really.

00:24:50.300 --> 00:24:51.710
I'm so glad.

00:25:21.290 --> 00:25:22.450
A scoop!

00:25:30.500 --> 00:25:35.590
The PR department told me to let you off this time because you rescued Minmay-san.

00:25:35.590 --> 00:25:39.600
But if you disobey orders again, you won't get off so easily.

00:25:39.600 --> 00:25:42.220
The punishment will be harsh!

00:25:44.730 --> 00:25:45.940
Do you have a problem with that?

00:25:45.940 --> 00:25:47.190
No.

00:25:47.900 --> 00:25:49.150
From now on you had better be careful.

00:25:49.190 --> 00:25:50.310
Got it?

00:25:52.650 --> 00:25:53.570
Yes, ma'am!

00:26:04.290 --> 00:26:06.580
How can a woman be like that?

00:26:15.920 --> 00:26:17.970
You did it! You did it, Hikaru!

00:26:17.970 --> 00:26:19.140
Ah, Senpai!

00:26:19.140 --> 00:26:21.970
You lady killer, you!

00:26:21.970 --> 00:26:24.100
You did pretty good!

00:26:24.720 --> 00:26:28.100
So how was it? How'd our idol Minmay-chan taste?

00:26:28.850 --> 00:26:31.440
I didn't know you were like that, Ichijo-senpai.

00:26:31.440 --> 00:26:32.480
I'm disappointed in you.

00:26:32.480 --> 00:26:33.610
Give us the details!

00:26:33.860 --> 00:26:35.900
I-I didn't do anything.

00:26:35.900 --> 00:26:38.860
You liar! You're just playing dumb!

00:26:39.200 --> 00:26:41.240
You have to take responsibility for what you've done.

00:26:41.240 --> 00:26:43.990
Really! We didn't do anything!

00:26:43.990 --> 00:26:48.000
So... you were all alone with her for <i>three days and you didn't do <i>anything</i>?!</i>

00:26:48.000 --> 00:26:48.580
Nothing.

00:26:48.620 --> 00:26:51.170
What? You still call yourself a man?

00:26:51.710 --> 00:26:52.630
Idiot!

00:26:53.750 --> 00:26:54.590
Huh?

00:26:57.170 --> 00:27:00.840
"What was she doing with Valkyrie squadron pilot Ensign Ichijo?"

00:27:00.840 --> 00:27:02.430
"Has she decided to outgrow her 'innocent girl' image?"

00:27:01.260 --> 00:27:02.430
What?

00:27:02.430 --> 00:27:05.470
"The man was a soldier. Is it an illicit relationship?"

00:27:05.470 --> 00:27:08.730
See, it's just like I said.

00:27:08.730 --> 00:27:12.690
You're right. No one's innocent these days.

00:27:13.440 --> 00:27:15.730
It's no wonder the entertainment world is in an uproar.

00:27:15.730 --> 00:27:18.690
I wonder what number he was.

00:27:19.200 --> 00:27:22.450
How despicable, changing lovers like that.

00:27:22.450 --> 00:27:25.740
What're you saying? You know, you're just jealous.

00:27:25.740 --> 00:27:26.700
Yep!

00:27:26.700 --> 00:27:27.790
No way!

00:27:29.580 --> 00:27:31.420
But the truth is she doesn't understand anything.

00:27:31.420 --> 00:27:32.420
That's right.

00:27:35.880 --> 00:27:42.590
Minmay-chan and the pilot Ichijo could have gotten out of the area if they'd wanted to.

00:27:43.470 --> 00:27:44.720
But they did not.

00:27:45.470 --> 00:27:47.180
So the real question is,

00:27:47.180 --> 00:27:47.970
I see.

00:27:47.970 --> 00:27:49.390
why didn't they?

00:28:16.210 --> 00:28:19.460
Lieutenant Commander, I've brought the patrol schedule chart for tomorrow.

00:28:19.460 --> 00:28:23.220
Thanks. Why don't you have a drink with us before you go?

00:28:23.220 --> 00:28:24.390
No, I...

00:28:24.390 --> 00:28:26.260
Just sit down!

00:28:26.260 --> 00:28:27.390
But...

00:28:28.560 --> 00:28:29.640
I'll be going now.

00:28:29.640 --> 00:28:30.600
What?

00:28:30.600 --> 00:28:31.890
I'd just be in the way.

00:28:32.350 --> 00:28:36.690
See, Hikaru? Your superior's being nice to you. Hurry up and sit down.

00:28:36.690 --> 00:28:37.690
Okay.

00:28:41.990 --> 00:28:44.740
What's with that face, Hayase?

00:28:45.160 --> 00:28:48.780
Good grief, act more like a woman when you're away from your post.

00:28:48.780 --> 00:28:51.040
It's not easy to change one's personality!

00:28:53.210 --> 00:28:55.000
You got me there.

00:28:55.710 --> 00:29:00.800
Listen, Hayase, even though you're an officer, you're still a woman.

00:29:00.800 --> 00:29:05.180
So even if what a man says is wrong, it's important to sometimes pretend he's right.

00:29:06.680 --> 00:29:08.010
Hey, Hikaru!

00:29:08.010 --> 00:29:08.890
Y-Yes?

00:29:08.890 --> 00:29:13.350
Sometimes a man needs to be aggressive!

00:29:13.350 --> 00:29:16.190
Don't get all worn out worrying about her feelings.

00:29:16.190 --> 00:29:20.980
If you really love her, you gotta have the aggressiveness to make her your own by force, if necessary.

00:29:20.980 --> 00:29:21.820
Okay...

00:29:21.820 --> 00:29:23.780
Oh, Roy. You have already said too much.

00:29:24.450 --> 00:29:28.160
Look, I'll show you how great it is to be a man and a woman.

00:29:28.160 --> 00:29:30.620
Open your eyes and watch closely.

00:29:31.040 --> 00:29:31.870
Roy!

00:29:34.080 --> 00:29:36.580
They're shocked.

00:29:36.580 --> 00:29:37.960
Like I care.

00:29:37.960 --> 00:29:39.170
Roy!

00:29:40.130 --> 00:29:41.800
Geez, Roy!

00:29:43.170 --> 00:29:44.840
Claudia.

00:29:47.180 --> 00:29:48.390
Roy!

00:29:49.180 --> 00:29:50.640
Excuse me,

00:29:51.390 --> 00:29:53.680
there is a phone call for Mr. Ichijo.

00:29:53.680 --> 00:29:54.850
For me?

00:29:54.850 --> 00:29:56.520
From one of your family members.

00:29:56.520 --> 00:29:57.520
Family?!

00:30:01.570 --> 00:30:03.690
Uh, this is Ichijo.

00:30:03.690 --> 00:30:05.900
What? No way!

00:30:06.820 --> 00:30:08.200
G-Got it.

00:30:08.200 --> 00:30:09.160
I'll be right over.

00:30:09.160 --> 00:30:10.280
Bye.

00:30:10.660 --> 00:30:11.950
What's wrong, Hikaru?

00:30:11.950 --> 00:30:14.660
S-Someone in my family's suddenly fallen ill.

00:30:15.200 --> 00:30:16.250
Excuse me.

00:30:20.460 --> 00:30:22.000
Family?

00:30:34.010 --> 00:30:34.850
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:30:35.180 --> 00:30:36.350
Oh, no...

00:30:36.350 --> 00:30:37.730
You recognized me?

00:30:37.940 --> 00:30:40.810
Of course. I have all of your photo collections.

00:30:40.810 --> 00:30:43.110
I tried so hard to disguise myself.

00:30:44.320 --> 00:30:46.110
Is it okay for you to be doing this?

00:30:46.530 --> 00:30:48.610
Don't you like being with me?

00:30:52.370 --> 00:30:53.620
All right then...

00:30:53.620 --> 00:30:56.290
Tonight let's paint the town red!

00:30:57.660 --> 00:30:58.660
Yeah!

00:32:51.650 --> 00:32:53.320
I'm sick of it...

00:32:53.320 --> 00:32:54.320
What?

00:32:55.450 --> 00:32:56.990
My life.

00:32:59.370 --> 00:33:03.540
Your dream was to become a singer, right? You have to endure a little.

00:33:17.470 --> 00:33:18.930
It's so beautiful.

00:33:21.680 --> 00:33:24.560
I wish I could go to a place like that.

00:33:40.620 --> 00:33:43.160
Won't we get in trouble for using this without permission?

00:33:43.540 --> 00:33:45.040
I'll take you to see something great!

00:33:45.040 --> 00:33:45.870
What?

00:33:45.860 --> 00:33:47.000
Here we go!

00:34:02.770 --> 00:34:05.060
Now then, open your eyes.

00:34:05.060 --> 00:34:06.100
Okay.

00:34:06.980 --> 00:34:07.850
Wow!

00:34:15.820 --> 00:34:17.280
It's wonderful!

00:34:17.280 --> 00:34:18.780
This is the rainbow of Saturn.

00:34:19.530 --> 00:34:21.280
Oh, this is the best!

00:34:32.500 --> 00:34:34.130
Vrlitwhai 7018.

00:34:34.130 --> 00:34:35.460
Yes, sir!

00:34:35.460 --> 00:34:37.380
Your report has been analyzed.

00:34:37.380 --> 00:34:39.760
Capture an enemy Miclone human as a specimen.

00:34:39.760 --> 00:34:40.390
Understood!

00:34:42.550 --> 00:34:45.560
What is he going to do with a specimen?

00:34:45.560 --> 00:34:48.940
The Supreme Commander must have a plan.

00:34:48.940 --> 00:34:49.980
Yes.

00:34:49.980 --> 00:34:51.150
Transmission received!

00:34:51.150 --> 00:34:51.650
What?

00:34:52.020 --> 00:34:53.520
It's from the reconnaissance unit, sir.

00:34:53.520 --> 00:34:56.820
They report the appearance of one Meltlan vessel across the primary warning line.

00:34:56.820 --> 00:34:57.990
What?

00:34:59.450 --> 00:35:04.790
Reinforce our defense. Do not let Meltlan near us.

00:35:04.740 --> 00:35:05.620
Yes, sir!

00:35:05.620 --> 00:35:09.580
If we do not act quickly, it is possible the Meltlan will succeed before us...

00:35:09.580 --> 00:35:13.250
Yes. Very well, begin the Miclone capture operation immediately.

00:35:15.630 --> 00:35:22.590
tsurenaku aruku anata no ato wo
You walk ahead indifferently

00:35:22.090 --> 00:35:26.890
fukurettsura shite otte yuku
I pout and follow behind you

00:35:26.390 --> 00:35:32.560
giragira tsuzuku shiroi sunahama
Along the long and dazzling white sands

00:35:32.560 --> 00:35:39.530
aitsu ni horeterutte yuu keredo
You say I'm crazy for him, but

00:35:39.900 --> 00:35:43.820
anata no hou ga suki na no yo
I like you better

00:35:43.530 --> 00:35:50.910
itsumo issho no SUNSET BEACH
We're always together at Sunset Beach

00:35:50.410 --> 00:35:56.050
shiokaze fuite BIG WAVE
The salty breeze blows, big wave

00:35:55.750 --> 00:36:04.300
watashi no kokoro ni sumitsukidashita
The guy who's forced his way into my heart

00:36:04.010 --> 00:36:11.770
aitsu ga youki ni hanemawaru
Jumps around in joy

00:36:11.480 --> 00:36:19.280
naminori taiyou PENDANT
Surfboards, sun, and a pendant

00:36:18.940 --> 00:36:20.690
SUNSET...
Sunset...

00:36:23.740 --> 00:36:25.780
It's no use hiding, Minmay-san.

00:36:29.410 --> 00:36:30.450
I'm sorry...

00:36:31.290 --> 00:36:32.210
Lieutenant.

00:36:32.750 --> 00:36:36.000
I can't believe it! Using a Valkyrie for a personal reason?

00:36:36.920 --> 00:36:41.010
It isn't Hikaru's fault. I asked him to take me!

00:36:41.510 --> 00:36:43.130
Minmay! Come back immediately!

00:36:43.130 --> 00:36:44.050
Nii-san!

00:36:44.050 --> 00:36:45.140
Ensign Ichijo!

00:36:45.470 --> 00:36:49.640
If the media ever find out about this, it would be the end of her career!

00:36:50.020 --> 00:36:53.890
I've already taken care of the big brass, but I won't have mercy on you.

00:36:54.480 --> 00:36:57.520
I understand. I was already prepared to take my punishment.

00:36:57.520 --> 00:37:00.360
What a pilot. Now hurry and get back to the ship!

00:37:00.360 --> 00:37:01.610
Understood!

00:37:02.490 --> 00:37:03.490
Let's go home.

00:37:03.490 --> 00:37:04.360
Okay.

00:37:06.570 --> 00:37:07.450
Oh no!

00:37:13.160 --> 00:37:14.620
Enemies!

00:37:14.620 --> 00:37:15.870
I know!

00:37:16.130 --> 00:37:17.330
Do something!

00:37:17.330 --> 00:37:18.210
This is Lieutenant Hayase.

00:37:18.210 --> 00:37:20.420
Relay this urgent message to Lieutenant Commander Fokker's quarters.

00:37:23.800 --> 00:37:24.750
Hikaru...

00:37:24.750 --> 00:37:26.640
It's okay. Leave it to me.

00:37:33.680 --> 00:37:35.980
Oh no, I forgot this is a trainer!

00:37:35.980 --> 00:37:36.900
Eh?

00:37:43.780 --> 00:37:46.530
That's strange. I wonder why they aren't firing.

00:37:55.620 --> 00:37:57.620
Damn it, stop teasing us!

00:38:05.050 --> 00:38:06.760
Hey, Hikaru!

00:38:07.300 --> 00:38:09.340
Making trouble again, eh?

00:38:10.430 --> 00:38:11.310
Senpai!

00:38:13.270 --> 00:38:15.140
But you did the right thing.

00:38:15.140 --> 00:38:18.770
A man's gotta be that aggressive or he won't get the girl!

00:38:20.150 --> 00:38:22.150
Senpai! You're drunk, aren't you?

00:38:22.570 --> 00:38:26.990
Idiot! Who can go to battle if he's afraid of alcohol?

00:38:39.460 --> 00:38:40.290
Great!

00:38:46.170 --> 00:38:47.800
Damn!

00:38:48.300 --> 00:38:50.390
Yahoo!

00:39:00.310 --> 00:39:02.150
Did you see that, Hikaru?

00:39:03.190 --> 00:39:04.320
Shit.

00:39:13.410 --> 00:39:14.280
Not good.

00:39:58.250 --> 00:39:59.000
Who are they?

00:40:00.540 --> 00:40:05.750
Debran's language is already interpretable. Answer Zentran's questions.

00:40:06.920 --> 00:40:11.260
How can male and female Miclones coexist?

00:40:11.630 --> 00:40:13.590
Male and female Miclones?

00:40:13.590 --> 00:40:14.850
What?

00:40:14.850 --> 00:40:16.760
I wonder what they're after.

00:40:17.220 --> 00:40:20.770
We have already found that men and women coexist on the same ship.

00:40:21.940 --> 00:40:24.310
What's the use in finding that out?

00:40:24.310 --> 00:40:26.770
It seems their culture is different from ours.

00:40:27.360 --> 00:40:31.780
Why does not debran fight? Why did debran become Miclones?

00:40:31.780 --> 00:40:37.120
Unlike you giants, we are Miclones from the time we're born.

00:40:37.120 --> 00:40:38.790
We did not "become" this way.

00:40:39.370 --> 00:40:43.290
"From the time you are boorn"? Does this "boorn" mean "manufactured"?

00:40:43.670 --> 00:40:44.960
Manufactured?

00:40:45.380 --> 00:40:46.590
Correct.

00:40:46.590 --> 00:40:50.380
Well, it's true that men and women cooperate to "create."

00:40:50.840 --> 00:40:54.760
Men and women cooperate? Yak deculture!

00:40:54.760 --> 00:40:56.140
Why do you not fight?

00:40:56.800 --> 00:41:02.730
Fight? Are you kidding? It's far better to hug a woman than fight her.

00:41:03.190 --> 00:41:05.650
"Huug"? What is "huug"?

00:41:06.480 --> 00:41:07.900
It's this!

00:41:10.610 --> 00:41:11.900
What do you think you're doing?

00:41:11.900 --> 00:41:16.160
Do men and women of your kind always perform such deculture?

00:41:16.160 --> 00:41:18.450
Yea, we kiss and everything!

00:41:18.450 --> 00:41:21.540
"Keese"? Do a "keese."

00:41:21.540 --> 00:41:22.540
That's...

00:41:30.210 --> 00:41:31.210
Minmay!

00:41:31.210 --> 00:41:32.090
What are you doing?!

00:41:35.470 --> 00:41:37.640
Do a "keese."

00:41:45.350 --> 00:41:46.900
I'll kiss her! Let her go!

00:41:47.230 --> 00:41:49.360
Very well. Do it.

00:41:53.490 --> 00:41:55.990
Hurry and do it, or they'll kill us.

00:41:55.990 --> 00:41:56.660
What?

00:42:04.160 --> 00:42:06.790
Keese!

00:42:24.930 --> 00:42:26.440
Minmay...

00:42:27.640 --> 00:42:28.810
Hikaru...

00:42:32.650 --> 00:42:33.820
Minmay...

00:42:34.570 --> 00:42:37.740
I wonder why they were so surprised by a kiss.

00:42:38.530 --> 00:42:40.950
It would appear that their men fight against their women.

00:42:50.420 --> 00:42:52.000
Is everyone all right?

00:42:52.000 --> 00:42:52.750
Yes.

00:42:52.750 --> 00:42:54.170
Somehow!

00:42:55.670 --> 00:42:57.420
Intrusion by Meltlan space attack squadron!

00:42:57.420 --> 00:42:59.840
Three of the Miclones have escaped in the confusion!

00:43:00.840 --> 00:43:03.050
Put the ship on full alert!

00:43:03.050 --> 00:43:06.680
Annihilate the Meltlan and capture the Miclones.

00:43:07.600 --> 00:43:10.150
It's unthinkable that we let this Meltlan intrusion happen.

00:43:11.350 --> 00:43:12.810
Pardon, Vrlithwai.

00:43:13.730 --> 00:43:16.690
We still have two Miclones in detention.

00:43:16.690 --> 00:43:19.700
We must take them to the Supreme Commander.

00:43:24.080 --> 00:43:25.240
We found them!

00:43:35.300 --> 00:43:36.550
Hikaru! Kiss her!

00:43:36.800 --> 00:43:38.050
What? Oh yeah, that's right!

00:43:38.050 --> 00:43:39.010
Excuse me!

00:43:44.180 --> 00:43:45.890
Unthinkable!

00:43:46.850 --> 00:43:48.850
Ouch! That hurt.

00:43:48.890 --> 00:43:50.440
Hurry up and launch!

00:43:50.440 --> 00:43:52.270
I'd do that even if you didn't tell me to...

00:43:54.980 --> 00:43:56.610
I have to rescue Minmay.

00:44:34.600 --> 00:44:36.150
Hmph. Too weak...

00:45:13.230 --> 00:45:16.980
Pathetic... aren't there any that are an even match for me...?

00:45:23.610 --> 00:45:24.650
Wow.

00:45:41.710 --> 00:45:42.800
It's a woman!

00:45:42.800 --> 00:45:45.380
Their men and women <i>are fighting!</i>

00:45:45.380 --> 00:45:46.720
What's going on?

00:45:46.720 --> 00:45:47.430
Hikaru!

00:45:47.760 --> 00:45:49.350
This is our chance to escape!

00:45:49.350 --> 00:45:49.930
Yes, sir!

00:45:59.110 --> 00:46:01.360
You will not escape, Miclone!

00:46:07.240 --> 00:46:08.160
Enemy!

00:46:21.250 --> 00:46:22.250
Senpai!

00:46:22.500 --> 00:46:25.420
Get out of here! Go rescue Minmay!

00:46:25.880 --> 00:46:27.220
If I do that...

00:46:45.900 --> 00:46:47.150
Hey...

00:46:47.150 --> 00:46:51.660
Hikaru, give my regards to Claudia.

00:47:00.580 --> 00:47:01.630
Senpai!

00:47:01.630 --> 00:47:02.130
Don't!

00:47:02.750 --> 00:47:04.210
Don't waste this opportunity his death gave us.

00:47:04.210 --> 00:47:06.130
What?! You're heartless...

00:47:11.890 --> 00:47:17.350
Minmay-san is carrying a homing device. Follow its signal.

00:47:17.350 --> 00:47:18.770
Roger...

00:47:23.060 --> 00:47:24.320
Energy level rising.

00:47:24.320 --> 00:47:27.320
Golg Boddole Zer fleet's flagship
coordinate calculations completed.

00:47:28.360 --> 00:47:30.610
Long-range fold, stand by.

00:47:39.910 --> 00:47:41.080
Minmay!

00:47:41.330 --> 00:47:42.460
Hikaru!

00:47:42.460 --> 00:47:44.710
It's Hikaru! He's come for us!

00:47:57.520 --> 00:47:58.430
This is...?

00:47:58.430 --> 00:48:01.520
A fold! This ship is trying to fold!

00:48:08.070 --> 00:48:09.070
Minmay!

00:48:09.070 --> 00:48:10.860
Hikaru!

00:48:14.240 --> 00:48:16.410
Hikaru... Hikaru!

00:49:05.920 --> 00:49:07.420
Minmay...

00:49:12.170 --> 00:49:13.380
Where are we?

00:49:13.380 --> 00:49:14.880
How should I know?

00:49:15.800 --> 00:49:17.010
And the enemy vessel?

00:49:17.010 --> 00:49:19.010
No sign of it.

00:49:19.010 --> 00:49:20.060
I see.

00:49:22.810 --> 00:49:25.940
In any case, what a creepy planet.

00:49:27.360 --> 00:49:30.440
It looks like an ocean over there! Can you fly us out that way?

00:49:32.030 --> 00:49:33.490
What for?

00:49:33.490 --> 00:49:34.320
What?

00:49:34.900 --> 00:49:37.280
Going there won't reunite me with Minmay.

00:49:37.280 --> 00:49:38.450
What are you saying?

00:49:40.120 --> 00:49:41.950
Minmay will probably be killed...

00:49:42.910 --> 00:49:43.960
Like Senpai was.

00:49:46.500 --> 00:49:49.250
If I hadn't taken her out, this never would have happened.

00:49:49.250 --> 00:49:53.050
But it's our duty to investigate where this place is.

00:49:53.590 --> 00:49:57.180
Duty! Duty! Is that all you ever think about?

00:49:57.590 --> 00:50:00.180
Fine. I won't ask you anymore.

00:50:01.930 --> 00:50:03.470
W-Wait, Lieutenant...

00:50:22.160 --> 00:50:23.620
Don't do stupid stuff like that!

00:50:40.180 --> 00:50:41.430
This is the...

00:50:44.270 --> 00:50:49.770
United Navy Pacific Fleet Offensive Aircraft Carrier...

00:50:50.520 --> 00:50:52.190
Prometheus!

00:50:52.190 --> 00:50:53.480
It can't be!

00:50:54.280 --> 00:50:55.400
This place...

00:50:56.570 --> 00:50:58.740
is Earth!

00:51:51.370 --> 00:52:00.010
gozen reiji no kane ga nareba
When midnight's bell tolls

00:51:59.510 --> 00:52:07.470
fushigi na mahou wo tokete shimau no
The wondrous magic dissolves

00:52:06.970 --> 00:52:15.110
furikiru you ni kakeorita
She bolts down the staircase, as if trying to outrun it

00:52:14.980 --> 00:52:22.700
kaidan no ue GLASS no kutsu
Leaving a single glass slipper behind

00:52:22.240 --> 00:52:37.710
marude CINDERELLA no koi tokei jikake de
Just as Cinderella's love moves like clockwork

00:52:38.880 --> 00:52:46.640
toki wo kizamu subete no mono
Let all things that tell time

00:52:47.350 --> 00:52:56.560
tomatteite yoake ga kuru made
Please stop, until the break of dawn

00:53:16.000 --> 00:53:17.710
"Protoculture"!!

00:53:17.710 --> 00:53:19.500
Protoculture?!

00:53:19.500 --> 00:53:24.010
Miclone with "Culture" is, therefore, Protoculture.

00:53:24.010 --> 00:53:25.430
"Culture"?

00:53:25.430 --> 00:53:32.100
Even I do not know much besides that it means "creative activity that is not fighting."

00:53:34.270 --> 00:53:40.650
Except for our programming, "Never become involved with Culture,"

00:53:41.320 --> 00:53:45.530
our Creators taught me nothing about "Culture."

00:53:45.950 --> 00:53:49.450
That strange sound is "Culture"?

00:53:49.450 --> 00:53:52.160
That is called a "Song."

00:53:52.160 --> 00:53:53.500
"Song"?

00:53:53.500 --> 00:53:59.630
I am a mobile fortress that has endured 120,000 cycles since creation.

00:53:59.630 --> 00:54:07.010
In my countless battles, I have come to comprehend a little of the "Culture" of Protoculture.

00:54:08.890 --> 00:54:13.520
This "Song" appears to have the power to bring men and women together.

00:54:13.520 --> 00:54:15.430
What power?

00:54:15.430 --> 00:54:17.770
Power that deprives us of our will to fight?

00:54:18.310 --> 00:54:19.520
Right.

00:54:37.370 --> 00:54:38.250
What's this?

00:54:38.500 --> 00:54:42.420
A "Fragment of Culture" that was captured a long time ago.

00:54:42.590 --> 00:54:44.510
"Fragment of Culture"?

00:54:44.510 --> 00:54:50.140
The two Protocultures may know what this is.

00:55:24.550 --> 00:55:26.880
In the end, Tokyo was destroyed too, huh?

00:55:28.930 --> 00:55:32.180
The United Forces Headquarters at the Alaska Base was buried in lava.

00:55:32.180 --> 00:55:36.100
We couldn't find one single living person in a whole week.

00:55:39.140 --> 00:55:42.270
So, where to now, Lieutenant Hayase?

00:55:42.270 --> 00:55:43.360
London?

00:55:43.360 --> 00:55:44.770
Or Paris?

00:55:45.400 --> 00:55:46.900
New York?

00:55:46.900 --> 00:55:48.320
Hurry up and give me your orders.

00:55:48.320 --> 00:55:49.280
Stop it!

00:55:50.780 --> 00:55:52.620
Please stop...

00:56:21.100 --> 00:56:22.810
There now, it's cooked.

00:56:28.360 --> 00:56:30.610
You haven't eaten anything in three days.

00:56:30.610 --> 00:56:32.360
At least eat a little...

00:56:33.200 --> 00:56:36.160
I would rather die before I eat that.

00:56:36.950 --> 00:56:39.290
The radiation neutralizer's working, so...

00:56:39.290 --> 00:56:41.000
a little bite of this won't hurt.

00:56:44.210 --> 00:56:47.090
Survival is also a soldier's duty, isn't it?

00:56:47.590 --> 00:56:49.010
It doesn't matter anymore.

00:56:52.170 --> 00:56:55.260
But we finally made it back to Earth.

00:56:55.760 --> 00:56:59.350
And if the Macross is safe, it will be here soon enough.

00:57:00.640 --> 00:57:01.100
Here...

00:57:02.480 --> 00:57:04.350
You don't understand anything, do you?

00:57:05.560 --> 00:57:08.610
The Macross won't be able to do anything even if it does get here.

00:57:08.610 --> 00:57:09.570
Why?

00:57:10.360 --> 00:57:13.400
There is no one left on Earth!

00:57:13.400 --> 00:57:15.360
The people on the Macross are still alive.

00:57:15.820 --> 00:57:21.950
The Earth was completely destroyed! The enemy is able to kill ten billion people in an instant!

00:57:36.140 --> 00:57:37.970
It's miserable, isn't it...

00:57:39.140 --> 00:57:41.970
being an officer in an army whose defeat is obvious.

00:57:44.810 --> 00:57:48.190
But you're much tougher than I am.

00:57:49.570 --> 00:57:52.940
Lieutenant Commander Fokker told me...

00:57:52.940 --> 00:57:54.150
Senpai told you?

00:57:55.240 --> 00:57:57.780
...that you don't have a family.

00:57:58.870 --> 00:58:03.330
Your mother died when you were very young, and your father died in an accident.

00:58:04.620 --> 00:58:07.370
He made a mistake during an acrobatic maneuver.

00:58:07.370 --> 00:58:08.920
Zoom, splat!

00:58:08.920 --> 00:58:09.750
Like that.

00:58:10.750 --> 00:58:11.710
I see.

00:58:12.670 --> 00:58:16.470
So you've been by yourself since then.

00:58:16.470 --> 00:58:18.300
I was just chasing prize money for air racing.

00:58:18.930 --> 00:58:21.970
I've been flying planes since I was small.

00:58:24.680 --> 00:58:27.770
But that's why you're holding up.

00:58:29.770 --> 00:58:31.440
Not me.

00:58:32.320 --> 00:58:38.320
I thought I was a soldier who would struggle for survival even if I was the last one left.

00:58:38.320 --> 00:58:40.160
But this is the sorry state I'm in now.

00:58:51.340 --> 00:58:53.630
I'm sorry, I...

00:59:26.500 --> 00:59:28.620
What's that column over there?

00:59:29.960 --> 00:59:31.250
Let's check it out.

00:59:49.940 --> 00:59:52.690
It appears to have sunk a long time ago.

00:59:53.480 --> 00:59:54.230
Yeah.

00:59:55.270 --> 00:59:57.440
It doesn't look like it's being occupied.

00:59:57.480 --> 01:00:00.530
But some of the devices seem to be working.

01:00:07.370 --> 01:00:09.210
They're made for our size.

01:00:09.620 --> 01:00:12.250
If these don't belong to the giants, then who?

01:00:12.960 --> 01:00:16.250
Could this be a fold communications system?

01:00:16.750 --> 01:00:18.170
Fold communication?

01:00:19.260 --> 01:00:20.380
It works!

01:00:20.380 --> 01:00:21.050
What?

01:00:21.050 --> 01:00:23.140
Maybe we can contact the Macross with it.

01:00:23.510 --> 01:00:27.470
But it'd be bad if anyone else intercepts the transmission.

01:00:27.470 --> 01:00:30.230
I know, but we must give it a try.

01:00:31.600 --> 01:00:34.610
If the Macross is okay, they should answer.

01:00:40.610 --> 01:00:41.950
No response...

01:00:43.160 --> 01:00:45.240
It's probably damaged.

01:00:47.910 --> 01:00:50.000
Or maybe you didn't operate it correctly.

01:00:52.710 --> 01:00:54.250
Let's try the other ones.

01:01:12.230 --> 01:01:15.600
"We have been waiting." For us to return?

01:01:15.600 --> 01:01:16.690
You can understand it?

01:01:16.730 --> 01:01:18.480
Yes, a little.

01:01:19.020 --> 01:01:20.360
Who are you?

01:01:24.280 --> 01:01:27.320
The main computer of a colonization vessel?

01:01:29.370 --> 01:01:32.540
No, we are people of this planet.

01:01:36.880 --> 01:01:38.380
Genetic manipulation?

01:01:58.520 --> 01:01:59.770
It disappeared.

01:02:01.230 --> 01:02:02.110
Wait!

01:02:02.150 --> 01:02:04.070
I still have questions!

01:02:06.610 --> 01:02:08.620
It's diverted its power.

01:02:09.070 --> 01:02:10.530
What did it say?

01:02:10.530 --> 01:02:15.120
It's diverting all that's left of its power to raising the city.

01:02:15.120 --> 01:02:16.870
Raising the city?

01:02:16.920 --> 01:02:17.920
Yes.

01:02:20.250 --> 01:02:21.880
It's moving!

01:02:30.300 --> 01:02:34.680
A long time ago, there was an interstellar civilization called Protoculture.

01:02:36.810 --> 01:02:40.360
They were advanced in genetic engineering.

01:02:40.810 --> 01:02:47.280
Eventually, the men and women were able to reproduce on their own.

01:02:48.280 --> 01:02:54.660
The men separated to become the Zentradi, and the women, the Meltlandi.

01:02:55.250 --> 01:02:57.210
The two began warring with each other.

01:02:58.080 --> 01:03:03.550
That was the time when they created the giants, who only knew to fight?

01:03:04.420 --> 01:03:05.210
Yes.

01:03:06.670 --> 01:03:13.850
But when the giants' fighting became too intense, those who finally realized their mistake

01:03:14.220 --> 01:03:19.900
decided to once again seek a place where men and women could live together.

01:03:20.650 --> 01:03:23.570
They found refuge on Earth.

01:03:28.280 --> 01:03:34.280
At that time, they manipulated the genes of the indigenous creatures

01:03:34.280 --> 01:03:36.750
and created our ancestors.

01:03:37.540 --> 01:03:39.540
They even created our ancestors?

01:03:39.540 --> 01:03:40.460
Yes.

01:03:42.290 --> 01:03:43.880
I see.

01:03:44.920 --> 01:03:47.300
Then where did the people of this city go?

01:03:48.170 --> 01:03:53.680
Twenty thousand years ago, the giants' fighting reached this solar system.

01:03:53.680 --> 01:03:58.310
They sunk this city to hide it and temporarily left Earth.

01:03:59.310 --> 01:04:02.230
But they were unable to return?

01:04:02.600 --> 01:04:03.810
Yes.

01:04:05.070 --> 01:04:15.620
So the computer mistook the Zentradi attack half a year ago as their return, and raised the city?

01:04:15.620 --> 01:04:20.540
And so that we could live here in this city.

01:04:21.960 --> 01:04:27.420
But after it waited for 20,000 years, we were the only ones to return.

01:04:30.050 --> 01:04:31.760
Truly...

01:04:41.390 --> 01:04:43.230
Everything seems to be in ruins.

01:04:43.230 --> 01:04:44.440
Yes...

01:04:50.070 --> 01:04:51.030
Ah...

01:04:53.450 --> 01:04:54.910
I wonder what this could be.

01:04:55.320 --> 01:04:56.530
Did you find something?

01:04:56.580 --> 01:04:58.660
There appears to be some kind of writing on it.

01:04:59.870 --> 01:05:01.250
"To remember..."

01:05:02.210 --> 01:05:03.370
"Remember..."

01:05:03.370 --> 01:05:05.250
"Do you remember?"

01:05:06.040 --> 01:05:08.500
Their characters are a lot more complicated than the giants',

01:05:08.500 --> 01:05:10.050
so I can't really understand it.

01:05:10.050 --> 01:05:11.220
I see.

01:05:20.640 --> 01:05:22.560
This looks like it's just an ordinary house.

01:05:23.230 --> 01:05:24.560
Let's go look somewhere else.

01:05:24.560 --> 01:05:26.730
Can we stay a little longer?

01:05:27.860 --> 01:05:30.110
I don't really have a reason...

01:05:31.240 --> 01:05:33.280
I just have this vague feeling of...

01:05:34.200 --> 01:05:35.160
I see.

01:05:35.610 --> 01:05:38.530
Well, I'll just go have a look around.

01:05:40.160 --> 01:05:42.000
I'll be back soon.

01:06:02.430 --> 01:06:04.230
Some things never change.

01:06:34.420 --> 01:06:39.800
As expected, no one else is here. Almost all the machines are useless.

01:06:47.310 --> 01:06:48.560
Welcome home!

01:06:49.100 --> 01:06:51.020
I-I'm home.

01:06:52.650 --> 01:06:54.820
Well, shall we eat?

01:07:11.420 --> 01:07:12.630
Sure!

01:07:15.340 --> 01:07:16.470
Please sit down.

01:07:58.420 --> 01:07:59.630
I want to go back...

01:08:01.800 --> 01:08:03.350
to where everyone is.

01:08:16.900 --> 01:08:18.190
Ichijo-kun...

01:09:01.570 --> 01:09:03.530
Is it going to start moving again?

01:09:03.530 --> 01:09:05.740
No, this sound is from the sky.

01:09:06.030 --> 01:09:07.240
The sky?

01:09:27.600 --> 01:09:29.010
The Macross!

01:09:30.270 --> 01:09:32.350
Our transmission did reach them!

01:09:42.440 --> 01:09:46.240
Hayase Misa and Ichijo Hikaru reporting for duty, sir!

01:09:55.080 --> 01:09:57.210
I am glad you made it back.

01:09:57.790 --> 01:09:59.790
How is Earth?

01:10:00.050 --> 01:10:00.840
Yes.

01:10:02.380 --> 01:10:03.970
During this last month,

01:10:03.970 --> 01:10:09.260
we searched 15,000 square kilometers of land as well as this alien city,

01:10:09.260 --> 01:10:12.060
but found no survivors.

01:10:13.770 --> 01:10:15.190
I see.

01:10:16.900 --> 01:10:19.310
I'll get the detailed report later.

01:10:19.310 --> 01:10:21.820
First, take a well deserved rest.

01:10:21.820 --> 01:10:22.860
Yes, sir.

01:10:44.260 --> 01:10:46.090
Did Roy die well?

01:10:47.130 --> 01:10:48.130
Yes.

01:10:51.510 --> 01:10:55.310
Thank you. That's all I wanted to know.

01:11:22.040 --> 01:11:26.720
akane ni somaru CAFE TERRACE
At the café terrace painted crimson

01:11:26.630 --> 01:11:31.470
TURKISH COFFEE no kaori ni notte
Carried by the scent of Turkish coffee

01:11:31.260 --> 01:11:36.310
TANGO no RHYTHM ga monouge ni
The rhythm of a tango listlessly fills the air

01:11:36.180 --> 01:11:40.520
hitori sabishiku STEP fumeba
Sad and lonely, if I take a step

01:11:39.850 --> 01:11:41.230
Minmay...

01:11:40.310 --> 01:11:45.360
Watashi no kokoro ni kaze ga fuku
A fresh breeze will blow into my heart

01:11:45.230 --> 01:11:49.650
konomama anata ga konai nara
If you're not coming at this rate

01:11:47.530 --> 01:11:48.780
It's strange, isn't it?

01:11:49.240 --> 01:11:55.660
Minmay-san is somewhere so far away, and yet her songs are still playing.

01:11:49.570 --> 01:11:54.580
konya wa dareka to odoro kana
I wonder who I'll dance with tonight

01:11:54.080 --> 01:11:59.330
SILVER MOON RED MOON
Silver Moon, Red Moon

01:11:55.200 --> 01:12:00.040
SILVER MOON RED MOON

01:11:56.660 --> 01:11:57.950
Her songs...

01:11:58.830 --> 01:12:04.250
tsumetai anata wa SHANGHAI DANDY
You're so cold, my Shanghai Dandy

01:12:01.880 --> 01:12:04.840
It's like she's alive.

01:12:04.040 --> 01:12:10.010
jitan no kemuri ga me ni shimiru
The smoke of Gitanes gets in my eyes

01:12:05.130 --> 01:12:06.170
Yeah.

01:12:08.010 --> 01:12:10.300
It's kinda nostalgic.

01:12:10.800 --> 01:12:12.510
Nostalgic?

01:12:15.810 --> 01:12:21.850
It's only been a month since the time I took her out into space,

01:12:22.560 --> 01:12:24.900
but it seems as if it was such a long time ago.

01:12:26.440 --> 01:12:27.440
Yes.

01:12:26.650 --> 01:12:31.660
yoru ga nakaseru GYPSY VIOLIN
The Gypsy violin that makes the night cry

01:12:31.450 --> 01:12:36.450
WINE no BOTTLE to GLASS ga futatsu
A bottle of wine and two glasses

01:12:35.950 --> 01:12:40.660
moeru omoi mo yarusenaku
Even my burning feelings for you are downhearted

01:12:40.580 --> 01:12:45.460
hitori sabishiku kanpai sureba
Sad and lonely, if I make a toast

01:12:51.090 --> 01:12:53.390
Milia 639.

01:12:53.370 --> 01:12:55.390
Yes, Moruk Laplamiz.

01:12:55.430 --> 01:13:00.430
The "Fragment of Culture" must be in the Protoculture ruin.

01:13:02.020 --> 01:13:05.060
For our victory, seize control of this ruin.

01:13:05.940 --> 01:13:08.940
Understood. I swear on the pride of Meltlan that I shall not fail.

01:13:16.200 --> 01:13:20.660
Enemy spotted. Approaching from area 27 at sea level.

01:13:20.700 --> 01:13:23.620
They are presumed to be the all-female Meltlandi.

01:13:23.620 --> 01:13:26.630
Only women? This is good.

01:13:26.630 --> 01:13:28.630
They may be women, but don't underestimate them!

01:13:28.620 --> 01:13:31.380
They might even be tougher than the Zentradi!

01:13:32.300 --> 01:13:33.630
That's interesting.

01:13:34.010 --> 01:13:35.140
Interesting?

01:13:35.340 --> 01:13:36.890
What's the matter, Ichijo?

01:13:37.260 --> 01:13:39.350
Did you lose your nerve all of a sudden?

01:13:39.350 --> 01:13:40.560
What?

01:13:40.560 --> 01:13:42.680
Squadron leader, Max is right.

01:13:42.680 --> 01:13:45.810
Maybe it's because he has a woman now.

01:13:47.770 --> 01:13:48.690
Kakizaki!

01:13:52.570 --> 01:13:54.400
What's the big deal about Protoculture?

01:14:14.550 --> 01:14:14.970
What?!

01:14:15.130 --> 01:14:15.970
I missed!

01:14:17.640 --> 01:14:18.470
Impossible!

01:14:24.640 --> 01:14:25.480
The enemy!

01:14:38.360 --> 01:14:39.700
This enemy is unbelievable!

01:14:42.580 --> 01:14:43.660
I won't let you escape!

01:14:45.660 --> 01:14:46.710
A battle cruiser!

01:16:02.530 --> 01:16:04.330
Damn it, at this rate...

01:16:10.710 --> 01:16:11.830
Minmay!

01:16:14.880 --> 01:16:16.340
What is this...?

01:16:16.350 --> 01:16:17.420
Where's this song coming from?

01:16:18.050 --> 01:16:20.170
How is Minmay-san...

01:16:40.900 --> 01:16:42.530
Beautiful.

01:16:45.660 --> 01:16:47.410
Beau-ti-ful?

01:16:53.460 --> 01:16:57.460
The soldiers' fighting efficiency has dropped considerably! What is this sound?

01:16:55.290 --> 01:16:55.790
What?

01:16:57.960 --> 01:17:00.130
Is this the "Power of the Ruins"?

01:17:19.110 --> 01:17:22.150
It is a success. Meltlan has retreated.

01:17:22.200 --> 01:17:27.910
If we can add to this "Song" what Minmay calls the "Leerics,"

01:17:27.910 --> 01:17:30.330
then we will be able to make Meltlan surrender.

01:17:41.670 --> 01:17:45.680
Captain, the Zentradi are proposing a peace negotiation.

01:17:46.220 --> 01:17:48.100
A peace negotiation?

01:18:09.280 --> 01:18:11.330
Man you, you want a cup of coffee?

01:18:11.330 --> 01:18:13.250
Ah, I don't believe anything.

01:18:13.790 --> 01:18:14.910
Good grief.

01:18:15.370 --> 01:18:18.130
How long are they going to make us wait?

01:18:19.210 --> 01:18:24.050
Captain Global will now make his official announcement.

01:18:33.220 --> 01:18:42.190
U.N. Spacy SDF-1 Macross, as of September 11th at 11:00AM,

01:18:42.190 --> 01:18:49.530
has established peace with the Zentradi 425th Boddole Fleet.

01:18:49.990 --> 01:18:51.160
What?

01:18:51.160 --> 01:18:52.330
What did he say?

01:18:52.160 --> 01:18:53.370
Oh, my God!

01:18:58.880 --> 01:19:05.590
And now the results of our investigation regarding the city-spaceship where we made our emergency landing.

01:19:06.760 --> 01:19:12.640
We found that the aliens who built it were the descendants of a highly advanced interstellar civilization

01:19:13.180 --> 01:19:18.190
called "Protoculture" that prospered more than 500,000 years ago.

01:19:18.190 --> 01:19:20.900
We humans, the Zentradi,

01:19:21.610 --> 01:19:26.360
and their enemy, the Meltlandi,

01:19:26.400 --> 01:19:34.200
all have the same genetic structure as the Protoculture's.

01:19:34.200 --> 01:19:36.950
He's saying we're all the same?!

01:19:35.330 --> 01:19:36.910
What should we do?

01:19:38.660 --> 01:19:47.470
They were created from human genes by the Protoculture's advanced gene manipulation science.

01:19:47.840 --> 01:19:49.430
Please observe.

01:19:54.970 --> 01:19:57.480
By utilizing the Protoculture's genetic engineering techniques,

01:19:57.480 --> 01:20:01.900
it is possible to change the giants back into humans.

01:20:04.520 --> 01:20:11.160
These three gentlemen sitting with us now are the Zentradi soldiers you have just seen.

01:20:12.660 --> 01:20:17.120
They are a warrior race that knows nothing of culture.

01:20:17.120 --> 01:20:20.080
They are split into two forces, the males and the females,

01:20:20.120 --> 01:20:23.790
and have been fighting each other for over 500,000 years.

01:20:25.960 --> 01:20:31.930
I thought we were forbidden to receive the Protoculture's broadcasts until the operation succeeds.

01:20:33.300 --> 01:20:34.600
What is it?

01:20:35.180 --> 01:20:37.930
Can you see those three?

01:20:38.470 --> 01:20:43.060
What about those three Miclones we sent to make the Earthlings stop fighting?

01:20:44.560 --> 01:20:49.360
I, Vrlithwai, have never seen a Zentran so full of Culture.

01:20:48.030 --> 01:20:51.700
This is the first time that I have ever ingested anything of such Culture.

01:20:51.700 --> 01:20:54.370
And to be treated like this by Meltlan—

01:20:54.370 --> 01:21:00.710
no, I mean women, is far more pleasing than to be treated the same by men.

01:20:55.280 --> 01:20:58.700
I also would like to try becoming a Miclone.

01:20:58.700 --> 01:21:00.710
That's ridiculous!

01:21:00.710 --> 01:21:01.960
I agree!

01:21:03.000 --> 01:21:04.420
It is a joke.

01:21:04.420 --> 01:21:05.790
"Jooke"?

01:21:06.460 --> 01:21:07.500
Do you not know?

01:21:07.550 --> 01:21:08.590
No.

01:21:09.300 --> 01:21:15.510
Minmay of the Protoculture taught me. Evidently it means "I am not serious."

01:21:16.100 --> 01:21:17.510
Unbelievable...

01:21:17.510 --> 01:21:22.600
And now, may I introduce the greatest superstar in the Galaxy:

01:21:22.600 --> 01:21:24.810
Lynn Minmay!

01:21:38.490 --> 01:21:45.670
This melody you hear now was decoded from an ancient Zentradi memory plate.

01:21:47.000 --> 01:21:53.720
Unfortunately, their memory plate did not have the lyrics recorded.

01:21:54.090 --> 01:22:01.350
As such, our lyric writers on the Macross are writing wonderful words to accompany this melody.

01:22:02.270 --> 01:22:06.310
And I wish to broadcast this song to the universe,

01:22:06.310 --> 01:22:11.650
so that we can negotiate for peace with the Meltlandi and establish a warless, peaceful world.

01:22:19.410 --> 01:22:27.750
We can take this first step towards peace because of countless sacrifices people have made in the past.

01:22:27.750 --> 01:22:30.960
All of us suffered through bitter times.

01:22:30.960 --> 01:22:33.920
Some of our young people were forced into this war.

01:22:33.920 --> 01:22:37.640
Some became prisoners; others were separated from each other; some were miraculously saved.

01:22:37.640 --> 01:22:40.890
All were overwhelmed by hardship.

01:22:40.890 --> 01:22:47.810
Now, here, a tearful reunion. The ones that Lynn Minmay has waited so long to see...

01:22:47.810 --> 01:22:52.570
United Forces' Chief Operator, Lieutenant Commander Hayase...

01:22:52.570 --> 01:22:57.740
and from Valkyrie Skull Squadron, Lieutenant Junior Grade Ichijo.

01:23:13.460 --> 01:23:14.880
Hikaru!

01:23:21.140 --> 01:23:22.430
Minmay...

01:23:25.140 --> 01:23:28.060
Hikaru! Hikaru!

01:23:31.610 --> 01:23:34.940
Hikaru! Hikaru! Hikaru!

01:23:45.580 --> 01:23:47.870
Hikaru! Hikaru...?

01:24:08.480 --> 01:24:09.940
"A maiden in love"?

01:24:09.940 --> 01:24:11.060
"The season of dreams"?

01:24:11.060 --> 01:24:13.360
These are all rubbish.

01:24:24.660 --> 01:24:26.580
"Do you remember...

01:24:26.580 --> 01:24:28.290
when our eyes..."

01:24:32.210 --> 01:24:38.210
"Do you remember when our eyes met..."

01:24:40.720 --> 01:24:41.970
It can't be!

01:24:56.190 --> 01:24:57.190
Coming!

01:25:05.990 --> 01:25:07.330
Minmay!

01:25:27.680 --> 01:25:30.060
You're pretty busy now, I suppose.

01:25:30.430 --> 01:25:33.270
By the way, are the lyrics to the song fini–

01:25:34.230 --> 01:25:35.400
Minmay...

01:25:38.230 --> 01:25:39.360
I love you.

01:25:43.400 --> 01:25:45.160
I don't know what happened...

01:25:45.160 --> 01:25:46.870
between you and that woman on that island.

01:25:47.700 --> 01:25:50.370
But... even so...

01:25:51.330 --> 01:25:53.460
I love you.

01:26:11.810 --> 01:26:14.270
Minmay, I...

01:26:31.950 --> 01:26:33.450
Lieutenant Commander!

01:26:38.040 --> 01:26:39.250
What is this?

01:26:39.630 --> 01:26:41.090
What do you mea–

01:26:42.170 --> 01:26:44.300
Do you remember what this is?

01:26:46.840 --> 01:26:49.510
This is the plate I found in the ruined city.

01:26:50.720 --> 01:26:55.310
When I decoded it, I found out that it's the lyrics to that melody.

01:26:55.480 --> 01:26:56.310
What?

01:26:56.890 --> 01:26:58.310
That song?

01:27:00.110 --> 01:27:04.030
I wanted you to confirm it first... but...

01:27:08.360 --> 01:27:10.740
Wait! It's not what you think.

01:27:10.740 --> 01:27:12.120
You're misunderstanding.

01:27:12.160 --> 01:27:13.620
"It's not what you think"?

01:27:16.660 --> 01:27:18.000
A "misunderstanding"?

01:27:21.750 --> 01:27:25.510
That's too much. Too much!

01:27:27.420 --> 01:27:28.010
Minmay!

01:27:32.100 --> 01:27:33.760
Hurry up and go after her.

01:27:35.980 --> 01:27:37.890
You two were just reunited.

01:27:37.890 --> 01:27:39.770
There's no reason to hold back.

01:27:42.230 --> 01:27:45.900
It's more miserable to be pitied.

01:27:45.900 --> 01:27:47.570
That's not it!

01:27:48.450 --> 01:27:50.320
That's not what I was thinking!

01:27:55.580 --> 01:27:58.580
We wandered the uninhabited Earth, just the two of us,

01:28:00.830 --> 01:28:03.380
and somehow made it safely back to the Macross.

01:28:05.960 --> 01:28:08.840
When I heard Minmay's song in town,

01:28:10.220 --> 01:28:12.720
and saw her on screen...

01:28:15.010 --> 01:28:16.060
that's when I knew.

01:28:22.860 --> 01:28:25.820
The one I wanted by my side forever...

01:28:29.820 --> 01:28:30.990
was you.

01:28:33.820 --> 01:28:35.830
I still feel the same now.

01:28:41.080 --> 01:28:42.250
Honestly?

01:28:44.500 --> 01:28:47.000
There's no telling when I might get killed,

01:28:49.590 --> 01:28:51.840
but if you'll have me as I am...

01:29:07.400 --> 01:29:08.900
What's wrong with me?

01:29:09.440 --> 01:29:11.900
It's strange, isn't it?

01:29:19.160 --> 01:29:21.460
But the tears just won't stop.

01:29:24.710 --> 01:29:25.670
Misa...

01:29:29.630 --> 01:29:30.960
Hikaru...

01:29:43.890 --> 01:29:45.940
It's a Priority one Red Alert!

01:29:51.690 --> 01:29:53.700
Attention! Red Alert!

01:29:56.320 --> 01:29:59.450
Take positions for maximum impact.

01:30:01.080 --> 01:30:04.460
Repeat, take positions for maximum impact.

01:30:04.870 --> 01:30:06.420
This is not a drill.

01:30:17.510 --> 01:30:19.600
Take these lyrics to Minmay.

01:30:20.890 --> 01:30:22.430
They're approaching in a cluster formation.

01:30:35.450 --> 01:30:38.490
What, you say the "Leeric" is not yet finished?

01:30:38.490 --> 01:30:39.280
Yes, sir.

01:30:39.320 --> 01:30:42.540
Also, Lynn Minmay is reported to be missing.

01:30:43.040 --> 01:30:45.210
Absolutely unbelievable!

01:30:45.830 --> 01:30:47.710
The Meltlan are de-folding right now!

01:30:45.870 --> 01:30:47.710
Holton Meltlan defold!

01:31:19.530 --> 01:31:24.370
You're the only one who can get Minmay-san to sing this song now!

01:31:25.290 --> 01:31:28.540
All of Laplamiz's fleet has de-folded.

01:31:29.040 --> 01:31:33.250
If the song is incomplete, then we cannot make Meltlan surrender.

01:31:33.250 --> 01:31:35.340
Therefore, we must annihilate them.

01:31:35.800 --> 01:31:39.510
Target the Macross and Laplamiz's fleet.

01:31:39.930 --> 01:31:41.850
All Zentran prepare for battle.

01:31:46.520 --> 01:31:50.980
So the peace lasted no more than a fleeting moment after all...

01:31:51.650 --> 01:31:53.690
All ships launch immediately!

01:31:53.610 --> 01:31:54.900
Aye, aye, sir.

01:31:53.820 --> 01:31:55.400
Let's get out of here quickly!

01:32:35.480 --> 01:32:36.650
It's begun!

01:32:44.530 --> 01:32:45.910
Enemy Boddole Zer!

01:34:14.370 --> 01:34:15.460
Hikaru...

01:34:20.130 --> 01:34:21.340
Minmay!

01:34:28.550 --> 01:34:30.600
You came...

01:34:30.600 --> 01:34:33.390
You came for me, right?

01:34:36.190 --> 01:34:39.310
I want you to sing this song.

01:34:40.270 --> 01:34:41.610
What is that?

01:34:41.610 --> 01:34:44.650
Why must I sing the song that woman found?

01:34:50.830 --> 01:34:57.210
We can only fire once because of damage to the stabilization circuit.

01:34:57.210 --> 01:35:00.880
Eskestos. Prepare to fire immediately.

01:35:01.210 --> 01:35:05.670
But there are tens of thousands of our ships in the line of fire.

01:35:06.090 --> 01:35:07.380
I don't care!

01:35:07.430 --> 01:35:08.590
Fire!

01:35:12.680 --> 01:35:13.310
What?

01:35:31.740 --> 01:35:34.200
Impossible!

01:35:36.200 --> 01:35:38.080
Even if I sing that,

01:35:38.080 --> 01:35:41.710
there's no hope that we can win anyway!

01:35:48.590 --> 01:35:51.090
Just stay here with me.

01:35:51.850 --> 01:35:55.390
If we're going to die anyway, I want to be with you.

01:35:56.730 --> 01:36:01.310
This isn't just our problem. It's for everyone on board the Macross.

01:36:01.350 --> 01:36:03.060
That has nothing to do with us at all.

01:36:03.570 --> 01:36:07.570
Why aren't we the only ones in the world?

01:36:09.610 --> 01:36:14.700
I wish everyone would die except us!

01:36:35.060 --> 01:36:36.180
Senpai...

01:36:36.180 --> 01:36:37.640
Kakizaki...

01:36:38.180 --> 01:36:39.390
They all died.

01:36:40.600 --> 01:36:43.190
They probably still had lots of stuff they wanted to do.

01:36:59.370 --> 01:37:01.790
You can still sing, can't you?

01:37:41.160 --> 01:37:43.420
I'm sorry, Hikaru.

01:37:46.130 --> 01:37:47.840
I don't know what got into me.

01:37:49.090 --> 01:37:52.470
I chose this path for myself.

01:37:55.720 --> 01:38:00.770
If I don't sing now, my mother and father who passed away won't be able to rest in peace.

01:38:02.600 --> 01:38:03.730
Minmay.

01:38:06.060 --> 01:38:09.980
I'll sing with all my heart!

01:38:36.720 --> 01:38:41.390
ima anata no koe ga kikoeru
Now I can hear your voice

01:38:41.390 --> 01:38:43.430
"koko ni oide" to
Saying, "Come over here"

01:38:44.350 --> 01:38:51.190
sabishisa ni makesou na watashi ni
Right when loneliness is about to overcome me

01:38:54.320 --> 01:38:58.950
ima anata no sugata ga mieru
Now I can see your figure

01:38:58.950 --> 01:39:02.240
aruite kuru
Walking towards me

01:39:01.950 --> 01:39:08.420
me wo tojite matteiru watashi ni
I close my eyes and wait for you

01:39:03.790 --> 01:39:05.210
What is this?

01:39:05.330 --> 01:39:06.920
It's Minmay singing!

01:39:12.500 --> 01:39:19.510
kinou made namida de kumotteta
Until yesterday, my heart was clouded by tears

01:39:13.920 --> 01:39:14.920
This is strange.

01:39:15.050 --> 01:39:15.920
This song...

01:39:16.550 --> 01:39:19.640
I feel as though I heard it a long time ago.

01:39:20.180 --> 01:39:21.510
Why?

01:39:20.800 --> 01:39:29.810
kokoro wa ima...
Now my heart...

01:39:29.810 --> 01:39:38.490
oboeteimasu ka me to me ga atta toki wo
Do you remember? The time our eyes first met

01:39:36.030 --> 01:39:37.320
I have found the answer.

01:39:38.110 --> 01:39:43.790
The Culture of those who provided our genes is being awakened...

01:39:38.490 --> 01:39:47.210
oboeteimasu ka te to te ga fureatta toki
Do you remember? The time our hands first touched

01:39:44.200 --> 01:39:45.290
What?

01:39:45.500 --> 01:39:48.500
After crossing over 500,000 cycles.

01:39:47.210 --> 01:39:55.800
sore wa hajimete no ai no tabidachi deshita
That was the beginning of our journey of love

01:39:49.790 --> 01:39:55.050
Can Culture be brought back to us?

01:39:55.800 --> 01:40:01.140
I LOVE YOU SO
I love you so

01:40:21.530 --> 01:40:27.700
67th Glruimual branch Adoclass Fleet to Macross: We will protect you from now on.

01:40:27.790 --> 01:40:28.540
Protect us?

01:40:30.750 --> 01:40:34.460
We cannot allow the Culture of Protoculture to be lost.

01:40:39.550 --> 01:40:43.010
To all listening to Lynn Minmay's song:

01:40:43.600 --> 01:40:46.010
We have but one enemy.

01:40:46.010 --> 01:40:47.970
Defeat Golg Boddole Zer...

01:40:49.600 --> 01:40:53.190
and restore Culture to our race.

01:41:01.910 --> 01:41:05.950
ima anata no shisen kanjiru
Now I feel your gaze

01:41:05.950 --> 01:41:08.950
hanaretete mo
Though we're far apart

01:41:08.950 --> 01:41:15.250
karadajuu ga atatataku naru no
It warms my entire body

01:41:11.580 --> 01:41:14.630
So this is Lynn Minmay's song.

01:41:19.510 --> 01:41:24.180
ima anata no ai shinjimasu
Now I believe in your love

01:41:24.180 --> 01:41:33.440
douzo watashi wo tooku kara mimamotte kudasai
Please watch over me from far away

01:41:37.520 --> 01:41:45.780
kinou made namida de kumotteta
Until yesterday, my world was clouded by tears

01:41:45.780 --> 01:41:54.290
sekai wa ima...
Now, the world...

01:41:54.290 --> 01:42:03.220
oboeteimasu ka me to me ga atta toki wo
Do you remember? The time our eyes first met

01:42:03.220 --> 01:42:11.890
oboeteimasu ka te to te ga fureatta toki
Do you remember? The time our hands first touched

01:42:11.890 --> 01:42:20.610
sore wa hajimete no ai no tabidachi deshita
That was the beginning of our journey of love

01:42:20.610 --> 01:42:25.610
I LOVE YOU SO
I love you so

01:42:25.610 --> 01:42:33.750
mou hitoribocchi ja nai
I'm not alone anymore

01:42:34.210 --> 01:42:41.590
anata ga iru kara
Because you're with me

01:42:43.170 --> 01:42:52.310
oboeteimasu ka me to me ga atta toki wo
Do you remember? The time our eyes first met

01:42:52.310 --> 01:43:00.900
oboeteimasu ka te to te ga fureatta toki
