01:43:00.900 --> 01:43:09.660
sore wa hajimete no ai no tabidachi deshita
That was the beginning of our journey of love

01:43:09.620 --> 01:43:15.410
I LOVE YOU SO
I love you so

01:43:20.790 --> 01:43:29.510
mou hitoribocchi ja nai
I'm not alone anymore

01:43:30.550 --> 01:43:34.310
Main target is at A-133, Z-165.

01:43:30.550 --> 01:43:38.100
anata ga iru kara
Because you're with me

01:43:38.980 --> 01:43:47.820
mou hitoribocchi ja nai
I'm not alone anymore

01:43:47.820 --> 01:43:56.120
anata ga iru kara
Because you're with me

01:43:54.740 --> 01:43:59.290
Protoculture!

01:43:57.250 --> 01:44:06.090
mou hitoribocchi ja nai
I'm not alone anymore

01:44:06.130 --> 01:44:14.470
anata ga iru kara
Because you're with me

01:45:48.150 --> 01:45:49.860
Skull One to Delta One:

01:45:52.950 --> 01:45:54.570
Mission accomplished.

01:45:54.570 --> 01:45:55.790
Returning to ship.

01:45:59.870 --> 01:46:01.790
This is Delta One: Roger that!

01:47:36.260 --> 01:47:38.550
Things will be difficult now.

01:47:39.590 --> 01:47:41.720
Even in this galaxy alone,

01:47:41.720 --> 01:47:44.810
there are supposed to be more than a thousand fleets

01:47:44.810 --> 01:47:48.270
led by mobile fortresses of Boddole Zer and Laplamiz class size.

01:47:48.270 --> 01:47:49.770
Indeed.

01:47:50.650 --> 01:47:54.480
However, just a single song did all this.

01:47:55.740 --> 01:47:58.950
We can only believe in the power of Culture.

01:49:32.000 --> 01:49:35.250
What was that song, after all?

01:49:38.800 --> 01:49:40.510
Just a popular song.

01:49:40.510 --> 01:49:41.920
A popular song?

01:49:46.640 --> 01:49:51.020
Just a song that was popular in an alien city, tens of thousands of years ago.

01:49:53.690 --> 01:49:57.980
Just an ordinary love song.

01:50:09.950 --> 01:50:12.120
One, two, three, four...

01:51:10.810 --> 01:51:11.970
A ONE TWO!

01:51:42.040 --> 01:51:54.220
tasogare utsusu madobe he to maioriru
When I look at the sky

01:51:56.140 --> 01:52:03.650
kirameku soyokaze suikonde
I breathe in the shining gentle winds

01:52:04.070 --> 01:52:09.700
sora wo miru toki
Reflecting the twilight flying down by the window

01:52:09.700 --> 01:52:24.750
kanashii dekigoto ga BLUE ni someta kokoro mo
Sad events stained even my heart blue

01:52:24.750 --> 01:52:33.720
tenshi no enogu de nurikaeru yo
I'll repaint it with angel's paint

01:52:33.720 --> 01:52:40.310
omoi no mama ni
Any way I want

01:52:55.530 --> 01:53:07.510
deatta goro wa sora ni sae akogareta
When we met, I longed only for Space

01:53:10.670 --> 01:53:23.480
watashi wo itsudemo mamotteta ai ni kizukazu
Without noticing the love that always protected me

01:53:23.480 --> 01:53:38.240
sukoshi no aida dake anata ni sayonara shitara
When I say goodbye to you for just a while

01:53:38.290 --> 01:53:40.120
I LOVE YOU
I love you

01:53:40.870 --> 01:53:53.220
kono kimochi wa namida ni kawaru deshou ka
Will these feelings change to tears, I wonder

01:53:53.590 --> 01:54:07.440
hitomi wo soraseba subete ga hanarete shimau
If I avert my eyes, everything will go far away

01:54:07.440 --> 01:54:22.370
itsuka wa eien no hikari watashi o izanau
Someday, an eternal light will beckon me

01:54:22.370 --> 01:54:37.010
kanashii dekigoto ga BLUE ni someta kokoro mo
